但在咱们这儿极速没用，
全看前轮抓地力。
But that doesn't matter here.
It's all about front-end grip.

938
00:51:12,667 --> 00:51:14,667
切入一号弯的
姿态很漂亮。
Going in nicely
into the first corner.

939
