好的，再次切进芝加哥弯。
噢，别别别。
Okay, into Chicago once again.
Oh, no, no.

942
00:51:27,067 --> 00:51:30,367
车头推头推大线了。
That nose is running wide.

943
00:51:30,400 --> 00:51:35,167
GT40比法拉利
多出整整150匹马力，
GT40 has 150 more
brake horsepower
than the Ferrari

944
00:51:35,200 --> 00:51:38,667
扭矩更是它的两倍，
但这可是美国车，
所以理所当然……
and twice as much torque,
but it's American,
so of course...

945
00:51:38,667 --> 00:51:40,133
