You have to say,
it does look absolutely
fabulous out there

952
00:52:01,067 --> 00:52:03,367
现在切出弯角，
逼近倒数第二个弯。
as he comes out now
to the second to last corner.

953
00:52:03,400 --> 00:52:05,833
前半圈它的表现
和法拉利不分伯仲。
First half of the lap,
it was neck and neck
with the Ferrari.

954
00:52:05,867 --> 00:52:08,867
能在这里逆转吗？
切进甘邦弯！
Can he pull it out here?
Now going through Gambon!

955
00:52:08,900 --> 00:52:12,567
噢，甩得非常厉害，
冲线！
Ooh, plenty of sliding there,
and across the line!

956
