45 cars on the wings.

985
00:54:02,733 --> 00:54:06,467
尽管满载状态下
重达将近400吨，
And even though it weighs
almost 400 tonnes fully laden,

986
00:54:06,500 --> 00:54:10,000
还载着机上按摩师小姐
