One engine produces
58,000 pounds of thrust,

994
00:54:41,200 --> 00:54:44,000
而眼前这架飞机足足装了四台。
and this has got four of them.

995
00:54:44,033 --> 00:54:47,700
不过58,000磅推力这种数据，
听起来挺空洞的。
But 58,000 pounds of thrust,
that's kind of meaningless.

996
00:54:47,733 --> 00:54:51,133
你怎么才能直观感受
这种恐怖的力量？
How do you get your head
around that sort of power?

997
