实在太危险了。
It's too dangerous
to drive them under here,
behind the engines.

1002
00:55:09,233 --> 00:55:10,733
车必须离得远远的。
They have to be well clear.

1003
00:55:10,767 --> 00:55:13,300
事实上，它们得一直退到这儿后面，
In fact, they have to be
way back here,

1004
00:55:13,333 --> 00:55:15,800
越过机尾，
还得再往后退一点！
past the tail,
and then a bit more!

1005
00:55:15,833 --> 00:55:19,567
这足足在发动机后方50码开外！
That's a good 50 yards
behind the engines!

1006
00:55:21,400 --> 00:55:24,867
第一辆要接受
这场“阵阵微风”洗礼的车，
The first car
we'll be subjecting
to a good stiff breeze

